{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/CharactersLogo_Small.png?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosmic Waves</strong> puts an entirely new spin on block destruction \u2013 the classic arcade genre made popular by games such as Breakout and Arkanoid. It merges traditional brick-breaking elements, including different block types and pickups, with many cool new features that bring greater depth, skill, and excitement to every bounce, rebound, and ricochet!\u00a0<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/pickups.gif?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A new dynamic in ball control:</strong> Utilise up to four energy towers and release force waves capable of changing a ball\u2019s momentum, trajectory, and power  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/towers_short_2.gif?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Super-powered paddle action:</strong> Boost your brick-breaking with a range of special weapons, and use unlockable gadgets to further enhance paddle capabilities   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/sphere.gif?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brick-breaking with a story:</strong> Join a duo of heroic wolves and their robot sidekick as they travel through space and face animal antagonists in a light-hearted adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/Enemies_n.png?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Station: </strong>Collect resources extracted from broken blocks or destroyed enemies and use them to increase weapon power, tower range, paddle durability and much more </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/upgrades_short.gif?t=1745913709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beyond blocks:</strong> Dynamic levels include a variety of different objects \u2013 switches, gun turrets, forcefields and more can all be targeted (sometimes with explosive results!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aim for a high-score:</strong> Completing a level is just the start! You\u2019ll need to smash the target criteria if you want to get maximum points and earn an S-Rank\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Block rocking beats:</strong> Enjoy an original soundtrack by Module \u2013 the award-winning composer behind the music for iconic brick-breaker, Shatter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2292540?t=1745913709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2292540?t=1745913709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745913709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745913709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"cont